{"id": "70536", "title": "狼爱", "author": "竹外桃花开", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 10, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70536.htm", "intro": "忠诚 不过就是滑了一下，眨眼间就穿越了时空。\n    想他原本是阳光美男，一下子缩水成娇小美少年。\n    先是一个哭的梨花带雨的爹\n    再来一匹高大俊美的狼夫君\n    唉唉唉，就算你比我高\n    可我是货真价实的大丈夫哎\n    怎么就被你缠上了嗯？\n    属性分类：穿越／宫廷江湖／生子／轻松", "base": "files/article/html/70/70536", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "10999106.html", "available": true}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "10999107.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10999111.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10999448.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10999449.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10999450.html", "available": true}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10999451.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "10999452.html", "available": true}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "10999453.html", "available": true}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10999454.html", "available": true}]}